00:15:19.759 --> 00:15:21.279
So I paid to learn cooking.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.039
I wanted to bring

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.519
better ingredients to the show.

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.279
I used my own salary.

00:15:26.799 --> 00:15:28.480
Family Feast has been three years now.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.360
Countless overtime,

00:15:31.399 --> 00:15:32.120
