00:18:36.799 --> 00:18:37.839
I'm waiting for a friend

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:39.400
Alright

00:18:40.519 --> 00:18:41.640
We'll wait for your friend

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.440
and order together

00:18:48.759 --> 00:18:49.359
Auntie Yu

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:51.119
Jiaqi, over here

00:18:52.519 --> 00:18:53.119
Auntie Yu

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.640
It's been so long since we met

00:18:54.839 --> 00:18:55.440
It really has

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.640
You're still so beautiful

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:01.079
Let me introduce you

00:19:01.279 --> 00:19:02.440
This is Lin Jiaqi

00:19:02.519 --> 00:19:03.559
She works in investment banking

00:19:03.839 --> 00:19:04.640
This is Xu Yan

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:05.799
Hao Ming's friend

00:19:06.839 --> 00:19:07.279
Hello

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:08.319
Hello

00:19:08.519 --> 00:19:09.240
Nice to meet you

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:13.480
Jiaqi

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.880
I heard you worked at a Wall Street bank

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.200
and did really well

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:18.880
Why did you suddenly come back

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.359
It was my father's wish

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.440
After so many years

00:19:22.519 --> 00:19:23.400
I've finally fulfilled it

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:24.920
And I just got

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:25.720
an offer from Hong Kong

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:26.640
The terms are pretty good

00:19:26.799 --> 00:19:27.480
So I came back

00:19:29.319 --> 00:19:30.960
The development here is great now

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:32.079
By the way

00:19:32.279 --> 00:19:33.640
Our family's Dewei project

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.440
was thanks to your help choosing a partner

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.640
You're too kind

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.200
You and Uncle Shen

00:19:38.519 --> 00:19:39.720
both watched me grow up

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:41.799
What have you been busy with lately

00:19:42.319 --> 00:19:43.640
I just got back recently

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:44.480
I'm taking a break now

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:52.400
Xu Yan

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.359
Yutong is a top young lawyer

00:19:56.839 --> 00:19:58.839
specializing in cross-border M&A and investment

00:19:59.599 --> 00:20:00.319
Now she's at

00:20:00.319 --> 00:20:01.759
her family's law firm

00:20:02.039 --> 00:20:03.039
handling international business

00:20:06.759 --> 00:20:07.279
Hello

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.200
Yutong

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:10.799
I saw your mom a few days ago

00:20:11.079 --> 00:20:12.359
She said you just handled

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.599
a multinational merger case

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.440
and did a great job

00:20:15.079 --> 00:20:16.359
Then I'll campaign for myself

00:20:16.559 --> 00:20:17.160
Auntie Yu

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.279
If your family has international business

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.119
remember to call me

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:20.400
Of course

00:20:20.759 --> 00:20:22.279
I wouldn't trust anyone else

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:32.680
Miss Xu

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:35.680
What do you think of these girls

00:20:36.359 --> 00:20:37.039
They're all great

00:20:37.559 --> 00:20:39.000
Each one is talented and beautiful

00:20:42.799 --> 00:20:43.359
Yes

00:20:44.079 --> 00:20:45.279
Girls like these

00:20:45.599 --> 00:20:46.559
are the right match for Hao Ming

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.279
I don't like beating around the bush

00:20:49.319 --> 00:20:50.480
and wasting each other's time

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:52.960
Although your image

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.279
and education are excellent

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:55.559
and your job is good

00:20:58.039 --> 00:20:58.920
But

00:20:59.559 --> 00:21:01.079
your family background isn't great

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:14.839
Last time we were together

00:21:14.839 --> 00:21:16.000
for quite a while

00:21:16.599 --> 00:21:18.200
you couldn't fit in at all

00:21:18.799 --> 00:21:20.119
but never complained

00:21:21.519 --> 00:21:23.079
Even when I asked you to get takeout

00:21:23.759 --> 00:21:24.839
you didn't get upset

00:21:25.519 --> 00:21:26.279
Even when ignored

00:21:26.319 --> 00:21:27.279
you kept smiling

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:30.680
Just like now

00:21:31.599 --> 00:21:32.720
still not angry

00:21:36.519 --> 00:21:37.200
Miss Xu

00:21:38.279 --> 00:21:39.480
Your problem is

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:41.839
you're too good at enduring

00:21:42.519 --> 00:21:43.519
As you saw

00:21:44.160 --> 00:21:45.799
these girls just now

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.200
all have a relaxed attitude

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:48.880
a sense of ease

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:50.839
That's what suits Hao Ming

00:21:51.519 --> 00:21:53.240
and exactly what you lack

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.039
You're better suited for

00:21:57.079 --> 00:21:58.799
someone truly in step with you

00:22:07.480 --> 00:22:08.160
Qiao Yan

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:10.079
Orphan, wild child

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:12.519
Orphan, wild child

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:15.319
Orphan, wild child

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:17.799
Orphan, wild child

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:18.799
I'm not

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:20.519
The wild child hit someone

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:22.000
The wild child hit someone

00:22:22.119 --> 00:22:23.559
I'm not a wild child

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.519
I have parents

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:28.440
My parents are abroad

00:22:28.519 --> 00:22:30.680
Far, far away

00:22:30.759 --> 00:22:32.039
Qiao Yan, liar

00:22:32.119 --> 00:22:34.160
Qiao Yan, liar

00:22:39.599 --> 00:22:40.920
Break up with Hao Ming right away.

00:22:42.039 --> 00:22:43.200
So you don't embarrass yourself.

00:22:46.559 --> 00:22:47.920
Syracuse University

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:53.160
It's the school where my parents

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:54.920
work overseas.

00:22:56.119 --> 00:22:57.359
They taught me from a young age

00:22:58.279 --> 00:22:59.880
that no matter the situation,

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:01.319
grace and manners

00:23:02.759 --> 00:23:03.839
are basic courtesy.

00:23:07.039 --> 00:23:07.960
I just didn't expect

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:09.079
that in your eyes,

00:23:11.559 --> 00:23:12.759
it's timidity and restraint.

00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:15.400
My work here in China

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:16.319
is all my own effort.

00:23:16.759 --> 00:23:18.079
I rarely mention my parents.

00:23:18.759 --> 00:23:19.960
But to you,

00:23:22.079 --> 00:23:23.200
it means a poor family background.

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:27.920
I can only say you're mistaken.

00:23:29.519 --> 00:23:30.160
I know

00:23:31.039 --> 00:23:32.039
you don't like me.

00:23:33.079 --> 00:23:34.000
That's understandable.

00:23:35.319 --> 00:23:36.359
But I love Hao Ming

00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:40.359
and won't leave him.

00:25:10.839 --> 00:25:11.480
What are you thinking about?

00:25:13.160 --> 00:25:13.880
Nothing, really.

00:25:15.279 --> 00:25:16.240
Just feel this family

00:25:16.640 --> 00:25:17.759
is a bit strange somehow.

00:25:19.359 --> 00:25:20.079
Strange how?

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:21.759
I can't put my finger on it.

00:25:25.079 --> 00:25:25.960
I think they're fine.

00:25:26.039 --> 00:25:26.440
Look,

00:25:26.519 --> 00:25:28.319
they're a highly educated family.

00:25:29.400 --> 00:25:30.839
If we become relatives,

00:25:30.920 --> 00:25:33.039
it'll help our company's image

00:25:33.119 --> 00:25:34.640
in many ways.

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:36.680
Don't overthink it.

00:25:36.720 --> 00:25:37.200
I think

00:25:37.480 --> 00:25:38.599
our son has good taste.

00:25:40.559 --> 00:25:41.680
Thinking too much.

00:25:45.000 --> 00:25:46.440
Maybe I'm just overthinking.

00:25:59.000 --> 00:25:59.640
Good morning, everyone.

00:26:00.720 --> 00:26:01.440
Good morning, Mr. Shen.

00:26:03.519 --> 00:26:04.400
Old Qu isn't here yet?

00:26:04.759 --> 00:26:05.759
I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:26:06.319 --> 00:26:07.519
Mr. Qu isn't feeling well today.

00:26:07.720 --> 00:26:08.319
He can't make it.

00:26:09.160 --> 00:26:09.640
Alright.

00:26:09.759 --> 00:26:10.839
Let's not wait for him. Let's start.

00:26:12.079 --> 00:26:13.559
About the new district

00:26:13.759 --> 00:26:15.079
complex commercial project,

00:26:15.680 --> 00:26:16.240
I'm planning

00:26:16.279 --> 00:26:17.319
to work with our upstream partner,

00:26:17.359 --> 00:26:18.519
Shifeng Group.

00:26:19.000 --> 00:26:19.480
They've also

00:26:19.480 --> 00:26:20.839
expressed to me

00:26:20.920 --> 00:26:22.480
an initial interest in cooperation.

00:26:24.039 --> 00:26:24.599
Shifeng

00:26:25.200 --> 00:26:26.920
is currently the largest

00:26:27.440 --> 00:26:28.680
and most well-funded company.

00:26:29.640 --> 00:26:30.720
If we can reach

00:26:30.759 --> 00:26:31.680
a partnership with them,

00:26:32.160 --> 00:26:32.759
this project

00:26:33.400 --> 00:26:33.839
will be secure.

00:26:33.880 --> 00:26:35.000
Looks like our chances are good.

00:26:35.000 --> 00:26:35.400
Yeah.

00:26:48.279 --> 00:26:48.880
Hao Ming

00:26:50.799 --> 00:26:51.200
Dad

00:26:53.119 --> 00:26:55.319
You didn't speak up in the meeting.

00:26:55.839 --> 00:26:56.440
Why?

00:26:57.680 --> 00:26:59.480
I'm not optimistic about Shifeng Group.

00:26:59.720 --> 00:27:01.119
Their new chairman, Mr. Zheng.

00:27:01.400 --> 00:27:02.000
What's your reason?

00:27:04.559 --> 00:27:05.160
First,

00:27:05.759 --> 00:27:06.720
Shifeng's resettlement housing

00:27:06.920 --> 00:27:08.400
had an accident at the construction site.

00:27:09.640 --> 00:27:10.599
His decision was

00:27:11.599 --> 00:27:12.480
to cover it up

00:27:12.960 --> 00:27:13.680
and suppress public opinion.

00:27:14.039 --> 00:27:14.920
He lacks responsibility.

00:27:16.079 --> 00:27:16.599
Second,

00:27:16.799 --> 00:27:17.759
he was parachuted in mid-career,

00:27:18.480 --> 00:27:20.359
meaning inside Shifeng

00:27:20.440 --> 00:27:22.200
he has no trusted team.

00:27:23.960 --> 00:27:24.519
Third,

00:27:25.200 --> 00:27:26.359
he brought three close aides.

00:27:26.640 --> 00:27:28.079
One is very social

00:27:28.680 --> 00:27:29.799
but stubborn and self-centered,

00:27:30.440 --> 00:27:31.279
offending people everywhere.

00:27:32.359 --> 00:27:33.240
Another one

00:27:33.599 --> 00:27:34.799
is older and experienced,

00:27:35.759 --> 00:27:37.519
but during the accident

00:27:37.640 --> 00:27:39.039
he was playing mahjong in a private room.

00:27:40.119 --> 00:27:41.000
The third one,

00:27:41.400 --> 00:27:42.599
the lowest ranked,

00:27:42.640 --> 00:27:44.039
is the most capable at work.

00:27:44.680 --> 00:27:45.680
He handles a lot of tasks.

00:27:46.279 --> 00:27:47.920
But long-term benefits are unfairly divided.

00:27:49.839 --> 00:27:50.440
Impressive.

00:27:51.440 --> 00:27:52.440
You've figured out

00:27:52.519 --> 00:27:53.480
their situation so thoroughly.

00:27:54.200 --> 00:27:54.559
Dad

00:27:55.240 --> 00:27:56.319
I think internally

00:27:57.680 --> 00:27:59.000
there will be turmoil.

00:28:00.079 --> 00:28:01.519
If you think Mr. Zheng

00:28:02.200 --> 00:28:02.559
right,

00:28:02.839 --> 00:28:03.960
has so many issues,

00:28:04.559 --> 00:28:05.319
then how did he become

00:28:05.359 --> 00:28:06.319
the chairman?

00:28:06.799 --> 00:28:08.240
That's his bigger risk.

00:28:10.000 --> 00:28:10.640
Hao Ming,

00:28:10.920 --> 00:28:11.960
in construction,

00:28:12.880 --> 00:28:13.599
if you haven't

00:28:13.640 --> 00:28:15.440
started from the bottom,

00:28:16.119 --> 00:28:17.440
haven't fought in this field,

00:28:17.720 --> 00:28:18.640
struggled and competed,

00:28:18.640 --> 00:28:20.359
for twenty or thirty years,

00:28:20.839 --> 00:28:22.759
you won't even know the ropes.

00:28:25.200 --> 00:28:25.839
Understand?

00:28:27.680 --> 00:28:28.119
I understand.

00:28:30.720 --> 00:28:31.480
Also,

00:28:31.680 --> 00:28:32.799
I want to bid

00:28:33.240 --> 00:28:33.880
for the new district's

00:28:33.920 --> 00:28:34.920
Plot No. 178.

00:28:40.599 --> 00:28:42.000
Such a big company like this

00:28:43.119 --> 00:28:43.599
sooner or later

00:28:43.680 --> 00:28:45.160
will end up in your hands.

00:28:45.960 --> 00:28:47.000
Right now,

00:28:48.240 --> 00:28:50.359
if you stay steady and avoid mistakes,

00:28:50.880 --> 00:28:52.359
that's your biggest achievement.

00:28:53.319 --> 00:28:53.960
You understand?

00:28:56.559 --> 00:28:57.039
I do.

00:28:57.720 --> 00:28:59.519
One meal, a cherished moment.

00:28:59.720 --> 00:29:01.039
This episode of Family Feast

00:29:01.039 --> 00:29:01.839
ends right here.

00:29:01.920 --> 00:29:03.559
Thank you all for watching.

00:29:03.640 --> 00:29:03.880
Got it.

00:29:03.920 --> 00:29:04.799
See you next time

00:29:05.039 --> 00:29:05.559
Goodbye, goodbye.

00:29:05.839 --> 00:29:06.400
Cut.

00:29:11.319 --> 00:29:12.200
Thanks for your hard work, Siwei.

00:29:12.359 --> 00:29:13.319
What a messed-up process.

00:29:13.359 --> 00:29:14.240
We've been recording for so long.

00:29:17.559 --> 00:29:18.920
Thank you, Teacher Sanmu.

00:29:19.680 --> 00:29:20.640
It's really late today.

00:29:20.680 --> 00:29:21.640
You worked hard too.

00:29:21.759 --> 00:29:22.240
Xu Yan

00:29:22.640 --> 00:29:23.200
To be honest,

00:29:23.960 --> 00:29:24.880
the reason I came this time

00:29:25.039 --> 00:29:27.000
besides Hao Ming,

00:29:27.559 --> 00:29:28.079
mainly

00:29:28.119 --> 00:29:29.480
I was moved by your sincerity.

00:29:29.880 --> 00:29:31.400
I was on a business trip in the US for a week,

00:29:31.599 --> 00:29:32.960
and you kept sending me messages.

00:29:33.200 --> 00:29:34.519
Whenever I messaged you,

00:29:34.559 --> 00:29:35.640
you replied right away.

00:29:36.920 --> 00:29:37.839
I'm really curious,

00:29:38.319 --> 00:29:39.599
do you ever sleep?

00:29:40.119 --> 00:29:41.480
Sorry for bothering you.

00:29:42.039 --> 00:29:43.480
That's just how our job is.

00:29:43.559 --> 00:29:44.759
We're on call twenty-four hours.

00:29:44.920 --> 00:29:45.440
So,

00:29:45.559 --> 00:29:46.440
if you have any questions later,

00:29:46.440 --> 00:29:47.359
just contact me directly.

00:29:47.880 --> 00:29:48.279
Sure.

00:29:48.519 --> 00:29:49.039
I have high hopes for you.

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:50.920
Next time you meet Hao Ming,

00:29:51.000 --> 00:29:51.799
let's have a meal together.

00:29:52.000 --> 00:29:52.599
No problem.

00:29:53.640 --> 00:29:54.400
You worked hard today.

00:29:54.480 --> 00:29:55.319
Go home and rest early.

00:29:55.559 --> 00:29:55.759
Come on.

00:29:55.799 --> 00:29:56.119
Alright.

00:29:56.400 --> 00:29:57.000
Take Teacher Sanmu

00:29:57.000 --> 00:29:57.759
to the guest room to change.

00:29:59.400 --> 00:29:59.839
Sister Yan

00:30:00.079 --> 00:30:00.759
The director backstage said

00:30:00.799 --> 00:30:01.559
those dishes just now

00:30:01.599 --> 00:30:02.680
need a few more close-up shots.

00:30:02.960 --> 00:30:03.440
No problem.

00:30:09.640 --> 00:30:10.680
Hello, Auntie Yu.

00:30:12.039 --> 00:30:12.759
Right now?

00:30:14.079 --> 00:30:14.680
I still have

00:30:16.240 --> 00:30:16.960
No problem.

00:30:17.759 --> 00:30:19.160
Please send me the address.

00:30:20.319 --> 00:30:20.759
Okay.

00:30:35.200 --> 00:30:35.720
Thank you.

00:30:36.920 --> 00:30:38.240
I'm coming in now, Auntie Yu.

00:30:39.640 --> 00:30:40.039
Alright.

00:30:45.119 --> 00:30:45.440
This one here

00:30:45.440 --> 00:30:47.160
is our Tongzhou Canal.

00:30:47.319 --> 00:30:47.880
And then,

00:30:48.000 --> 00:30:49.279
there's the central business district nearby.

00:30:50.039 --> 00:30:51.039
Sorry, Auntie Yu,

00:30:51.640 --> 00:30:52.960
I was late because of traffic.

00:30:53.680 --> 00:30:54.720
We've been waiting for you.

00:30:56.279 --> 00:30:57.160
It wasn't easy today

00:30:57.160 --> 00:30:57.920
to arrange for President Meng

00:30:58.079 --> 00:30:59.319
to join us for house viewing.

00:30:59.559 --> 00:31:00.720
And you made others wait so long.

00:31:01.440 --> 00:31:01.960
Auntie Meng

00:31:02.279 --> 00:31:02.880
Sorry.

00:31:03.039 --> 00:31:03.559
It's fine.

00:31:04.440 --> 00:31:05.799
Let's hurry and take a look.

00:31:05.960 --> 00:31:06.880
I have another appointment this afternoon.

00:31:06.920 --> 00:31:07.279
Okay.

00:31:14.480 --> 00:31:15.359
The whole development's

00:31:15.400 --> 00:31:16.200
land area

00:31:16.279 --> 00:31:18.160
is 35,000 square meters.

00:31:18.519 --> 00:31:20.480
There are eight buildings in total.

00:31:20.640 --> 00:31:22.559
Six are garden houses,

00:31:22.640 --> 00:31:23.880
two are high-rises.

00:31:24.519 --> 00:31:26.200
The size range is

00:31:26.200 --> 00:31:26.960
one hundred ninety-nine

00:31:27.039 --> 00:31:28.400
to one hundred forty-three.

00:31:28.920 --> 00:31:29.519
Sister Lan

00:31:29.960 --> 00:31:30.880
This time, buying a house

00:31:30.920 --> 00:31:32.079
is for whom?

00:31:32.400 --> 00:31:32.880
My son.

00:31:33.119 --> 00:31:33.839
He's getting married.

00:31:34.400 --> 00:31:35.279
Really?

00:31:35.400 --> 00:31:36.480
Congratulations, Sister Lan.

00:31:36.640 --> 00:31:38.480
Young President Shen is getting married so soon.

00:31:38.759 --> 00:31:39.799
I wonder which family's daughter

00:31:39.839 --> 00:31:40.920
is so lucky.

00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:46.559
Look at me, so clueless.

00:31:47.599 --> 00:31:48.519
Hello, ma'am.

00:31:48.880 --> 00:31:49.599
My name is Lisa.

00:31:49.839 --> 00:31:50.799
If you have any requests,

00:31:50.920 --> 00:31:51.640
just let me know.

00:31:51.680 --> 00:31:52.440
I'll make sure you're satisfied.

00:31:52.559 --> 00:31:53.480
Thank you, sorry for the trouble.

00:31:53.599 --> 00:31:54.000
It's nothing.

00:31:54.880 --> 00:31:55.279
Lisa

00:31:55.279 --> 00:31:57.119
Which units did you prepare for me?

00:31:57.359 --> 00:31:58.480
The ones I prepared for us

00:31:58.519 --> 00:32:00.160
are the best units in the development.

00:32:00.240 --> 00:32:02.039
Building 6, unit 606,

00:32:02.480 --> 00:32:03.400
706,

00:32:03.680 --> 00:32:04.720
and 808.

00:32:05.480 --> 00:32:06.359
These three units

00:32:06.400 --> 00:32:07.440
are definitely the best

00:32:07.519 --> 00:32:08.000
and largest

00:32:08.119 --> 00:32:09.079
layouts in the development.

00:32:09.119 --> 00:32:10.279
I've reserved all of them for you.

00:32:10.839 --> 00:32:11.400
Ma'am,

00:32:11.839 --> 00:32:12.960
what do you think?

00:32:16.640 --> 00:32:17.319
They're all great.

00:32:19.160 --> 00:32:19.759
Auntie Yu,

00:32:21.519 --> 00:32:23.000
should we ask Hao Ming's opinion?

00:32:28.240 --> 00:32:29.000
Miss Xu

00:32:29.440 --> 00:32:31.079
For things like buying a wedding home

00:32:31.839 --> 00:32:33.279
Aunt Lan should definitely decide

00:32:34.480 --> 00:32:35.200
You young people

00:32:35.240 --> 00:32:36.720
don’t really understand houses

00:32:36.960 --> 00:32:37.720
Not to mention anything else

00:32:38.000 --> 00:32:39.599
just the direction of the house

00:32:39.640 --> 00:32:40.640
and the floor, for example

00:32:40.799 --> 00:32:42.119
You probably have no idea, right?

00:32:42.240 --> 00:32:43.759
In a few years, you’ll want kids

00:32:44.200 --> 00:32:45.160
so you need to think carefully

00:32:45.200 --> 00:32:46.599
about the house’s layout

00:32:46.759 --> 00:32:48.079
and what style to decorate it in

00:32:48.319 --> 00:32:49.440
This isn’t a joke

00:32:49.880 --> 00:32:51.400
If you choose the wrong house

00:32:52.039 --> 00:32:53.119
it’ll affect your married life

00:32:53.160 --> 00:32:54.440
in a very big way

00:32:56.559 --> 00:32:57.640
Thank you, Auntie Meng

00:32:58.759 --> 00:32:59.319
When buying a house

00:32:59.319 --> 00:33:00.680
we’ll definitely listen to Auntie Yu

00:33:02.319 --> 00:33:03.880
I just meant to say

00:33:03.920 --> 00:33:04.519
should we let Hao Ming

00:33:04.519 --> 00:33:05.480
come over and take a look together?

00:33:05.799 --> 00:33:06.319
No need

00:33:07.759 --> 00:33:08.519
He’s so busy

00:33:09.039 --> 00:33:10.240
We can decide for him

00:33:10.920 --> 00:33:11.359
Okay

00:33:14.960 --> 00:33:15.720
I understand

00:33:16.519 --> 00:33:18.519
Miss Xu probably doesn’t look at houses often

00:33:18.640 --> 00:33:19.519
She doesn’t have much experience

00:33:20.599 --> 00:33:21.480
But that’s alright

00:33:21.920 --> 00:33:22.759
Auntie Meng is here

00:33:23.079 --> 00:33:24.359
I’ll help you two

00:33:24.400 --> 00:33:25.400
pick the best house

00:33:25.799 --> 00:33:26.240
Thank you

00:33:27.160 --> 00:33:28.200
You don’t have to say that

00:33:28.359 --> 00:33:29.440
We’re getting older

00:33:29.920 --> 00:33:30.519
We really don’t know

00:33:30.559 --> 00:33:31.759
what young people are thinking

00:33:32.680 --> 00:33:33.359
Xu Yan’s father

00:33:33.400 --> 00:33:34.559
studied architecture

00:33:35.240 --> 00:33:36.720
She’s been influenced since childhood

00:33:37.119 --> 00:33:37.599
So it’s perfect

00:33:38.000 --> 00:33:39.720
You can look from a professional view

00:33:39.960 --> 00:33:40.960
at these houses

00:33:41.359 --> 00:33:42.319
and see which is best

00:34:22.559 --> 00:34:23.000
Mom

00:34:31.800 --> 00:34:32.360
Son

00:34:32.760 --> 00:34:33.599
Why are you here?

00:34:36.360 --> 00:34:37.239
Did you tell him?

00:34:38.880 --> 00:34:39.639
No, Auntie Yu

00:34:39.719 --> 00:34:40.079
I didn’t

00:34:40.119 --> 00:34:40.800
No

00:34:41.400 --> 00:34:42.400
I asked the driver where you were

00:34:42.519 --> 00:34:43.679
He said you were here

00:34:43.920 --> 00:34:45.719
So I guessed you were buying me a house

00:34:46.000 --> 00:34:46.960
I forgot to tell you

00:34:47.000 --> 00:34:48.360
I’ve already picked out the house

00:34:48.920 --> 00:34:49.719
When did this happen?

00:34:49.760 --> 00:34:50.679
I had no idea

00:34:51.079 --> 00:34:52.079
It’s been a while

00:34:52.639 --> 00:34:53.800
I didn’t even tell Yan Yan

00:34:55.480 --> 00:34:56.599
I wanted to surprise you

00:34:58.519 --> 00:34:59.119
This kid

00:34:59.400 --> 00:35:00.440
But the houses here are nice

00:35:00.840 --> 00:35:01.880
If there’s nothing else

00:35:02.320 --> 00:35:02.960
I’ll go with my girlfriend

00:35:02.960 --> 00:35:03.599
on our date now

00:35:05.199 --> 00:35:05.599
Bye

00:35:06.679 --> 00:35:07.280
Bye, Auntie Meng

00:35:07.360 --> 00:35:07.760
Alright

00:35:07.840 --> 00:35:09.159
I spent a long time choosing this house

00:35:09.480 --> 00:35:09.880
Lisa

00:35:11.239 --> 00:35:11.960
Sorry about that

00:35:13.000 --> 00:35:13.559
Okay, okay

00:35:13.760 --> 00:35:14.360
Take your time looking

00:35:14.400 --> 00:35:14.760
Bye

00:35:16.360 --> 00:35:17.599
We’ll head out now, Auntie Yu

00:35:17.639 --> 00:35:18.239
Thank you

00:35:18.840 --> 00:35:19.719
Goodbye, Auntie Meng

00:35:48.239 --> 00:35:49.639
I keep forgetting to ask you

00:35:50.639 --> 00:35:51.079
why

00:35:51.119 --> 00:35:52.239
you like agave so much

00:35:54.199 --> 00:35:56.360
Agave only blooms once in its life

00:35:59.960 --> 00:36:01.599
after growing for decades

00:36:02.039 --> 00:36:03.280
using all its strength

00:36:03.599 --> 00:36:04.599
to create a cloud of flowers

00:36:09.119 --> 00:36:09.920
I really love

00:36:09.960 --> 00:36:11.039
its tenacious vitality

00:36:12.199 --> 00:36:12.679
And also

00:36:13.440 --> 00:36:14.239
how it stores up energy

00:36:15.079 --> 00:36:15.960
inside itself

00:36:16.199 --> 00:36:17.639
waiting for that one burst in a lifetime

00:36:19.119 --> 00:36:20.039
It’s a species that’s existed

00:36:20.079 --> 00:36:21.079
for hundreds of millions of years

00:36:22.199 --> 00:36:23.239
That kind of vitality

00:36:24.119 --> 00:36:25.519
is unique among plants

00:36:26.400 --> 00:36:26.960
Yan Yan

00:36:28.079 --> 00:36:28.679
Come try

00:36:29.079 --> 00:36:29.880
the Mexican wraps I made

00:36:34.000 --> 00:36:34.719
They’re ready

00:36:36.679 --> 00:36:37.760
They come from the same place

00:36:38.199 --> 00:36:39.480
as agave

00:36:42.119 --> 00:36:42.760
Is it good?

00:36:46.400 --> 00:36:47.559
You’re a great cook

00:36:50.000 --> 00:36:50.920
This is for you

00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:54.840
Why

00:36:54.840 --> 00:36:55.840
are you suddenly giving me a gift?

00:36:57.599 --> 00:36:59.119
You’ve worked hard accompanying my mom lately

00:37:00.800 --> 00:37:01.840
I’ll tell her

00:37:02.480 --> 00:37:03.480
not to take up

00:37:03.920 --> 00:37:04.840
too much of your time

00:37:05.880 --> 00:37:06.599
Every time Auntie

00:37:06.639 --> 00:37:08.199
always schedules with me in advance

00:37:08.360 --> 00:37:09.920
She never delays anything for me

00:37:09.960 --> 00:37:10.599
Don’t worry

00:37:11.480 --> 00:37:13.239
Your planner is packed

00:37:13.360 --> 00:37:14.639
with my mom’s schedule

00:37:15.519 --> 00:37:16.280
But you’ve never

00:37:16.320 --> 00:37:17.559
complained to me once

00:37:19.320 --> 00:37:20.199
So what’s this?

00:37:21.519 --> 00:37:22.679
A reward for a good student

00:37:24.239 --> 00:37:24.760
Yan Yan

00:37:25.840 --> 00:37:26.480
Your kindness

00:37:27.280 --> 00:37:28.840
makes me want to give you

00:37:29.480 --> 00:37:30.239
all the good things I see

00:37:42.320 --> 00:37:43.159
I heard you’re applying

00:37:43.199 --> 00:37:44.360
to be the hostess of Family Feast, right?

00:37:47.760 --> 00:37:48.639
How did you know?

00:37:50.280 --> 00:37:51.119
I also know

00:37:51.280 --> 00:37:52.639
the current hostess

00:37:52.880 --> 00:37:54.320
is a bit overbearing

00:37:54.559 --> 00:37:55.800
and especially loves to complain to her mom

00:37:57.079 --> 00:37:57.840
Don’t worry

00:37:59.159 --> 00:37:59.719
about these things

00:38:00.280 --> 00:38:01.519
I can help you handle them

00:38:06.480 --> 00:38:07.800
Thank you for your kindness

00:38:08.599 --> 00:38:09.679
But I don’t need you to help me like that

00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:12.280
She has her family’s support

00:38:13.039 --> 00:38:13.599
And so do you

00:38:25.760 --> 00:38:26.320
Hao Ming

00:38:29.119 --> 00:38:29.960
You made me realize

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:31.599
the best man in the world.

00:38:34.679 --> 00:38:35.559
Thank you for loving me.

00:38:38.760 --> 00:38:40.199
But when it comes to work,

00:38:42.079 --> 00:38:42.960
you have to trust me.

00:38:43.920 --> 00:38:44.719
I can handle it.

00:38:46.840 --> 00:38:47.280
Okay.

00:38:48.559 --> 00:38:49.239
I trust you.

00:38:51.119 --> 00:38:52.079
Eat quickly, it's getting cold.

00:38:53.440 --> 00:38:53.920
One more.

00:38:54.760 --> 00:38:55.360
Have another.

00:38:56.119 --> 00:38:56.760
Alright, come here.

00:38:57.039 --> 00:38:57.559
I'll show you.

00:38:59.599 --> 00:39:00.039
Come.

00:39:05.199 --> 00:39:07.280
Every time Hao Ming confesses sincerely,

00:39:07.679 --> 00:39:08.840
every time he supports me,

00:39:09.559 --> 00:39:11.159
it's as if he's always asking me,

00:39:12.199 --> 00:39:13.719
Do you deserve pure love?